		"name": "CrimeNet-API",
		"description": "Comprehensive Postman QA Test Suite for CrimeNet OS RESTful APIs (Auth, Inmates, Audit Logs). Validates status codes, JSON schemas, JWT authentication, and Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).",
